    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Brady are delighted to offer for sale this 2 bedroom renovated cottage. A wonderful opportunity to acquire a very nice renovated two-bedroom cottage, set on a generous and private site of circa 0.7 acres in a peaceful countryside setting. The property has been upgraded while retaining the charm and character of a traditional cottage, offering comfortable, modern accommodation with excellent potential for both permanent living and a countryside retreat. The accommodation comprises 2 living areas (or could be used for office or a third bedroom), kitchen/dining area at the rear with patio door to external area, two bedrooms and a modern bathroom. The cottage is presented in very good condition and is ready for immediate occupation. \n\nOutside, the property benefits from a large site, providing lots of space for garden, outdoor entertaining, parking and a range of possible uses. There is also an outbuilding which further enhances the property and would be ideal for storage space. Surrounded by peaceful countryside and offering a high degree of privacy, this is an ideal property for those seeking a peaceful rural lifestyle without compromising on comfort. High speed broadband 500mb available at the house. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the setting, privacy and quality of this charming country property. Phone Celia for more information or to organise a viewing on 071 9622444. OPEN VIEWING SATURDAY 29TH AUGUST 12 TO 1.30PM \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Porch\n2.14m x 1.94m Entrance porch with window to front view, door with glass to living room, glass door, power points\n\nLiving Room\n4.40m x 3.80m Living room with laminated flooring, window to front view, place left to insert stove, power points, Airing cupboard, immersion, door to rear hallway\n\nHallway\n Rear hallway with tiling, door at either end\n\nBoiler House\n1.76m x 0.90m Boiler room with window, grant boiler\n\nSitting Room\n4.11m x 3.81m Sittingroom with laminated flooring, open fireplace, window to front, radiator and power points, door to hallway.\n\nBathroom\n2.59m x 1.83m Bathroom with tiled floor, electric shower, whb, wc, window to rear, mirror and light, radiator, wooden ceiling.\n\nDining Area\n5.98m x 2.72m Dining area part of kitchen/dining area, patio door to rear of house, timber ceiling, laminated flooring, opening to kithcen, plumbed for washer. kitchen with fitted units, dishwasher, single drainer sink, electric hob and oven, tiled floor, tiled over counter, power points, large window to rear, sliding door back to hallway\n\nBedroom 1\n3.87m x 3.64m Double bedroom to the front of the house, laminated flooring, radiator, window to front, power points.\n\nBedroom 2\n5.36m x 2.66m Double bedroom at the rear with laminated flooring, window to rear, radiator, power points, separate dressing room/storage area.\n\n\nOutside\nLarge site Lots of parking Outbuilding"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Character and charm throughout\nIdeal permanent home, holiday retreat or investment opportunity\nExcellent potential for further development, subject to planning\n \n Well renovated two-bedroom cottage\nLarge private site\nExcellent countryside location\nDetached outbuilding\nAmple parking\nOutdoor space\nHigh speed broadband 500mb available at the house\n \n Close to many lakes and countryside walks\nWithin 10 mins driving distance to Ballinamore with schools, childcare facilities, sports facilities, many shops,"
      },
